==Bulgarian==
{{number box|bg|6}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|bg|sla-pro|*šestь}}, from {{inh|bg|ine-pro|*swéḱs}}.

The “best” sense is derived from the Bulgarian schooling system's 2-6 grade scale, where a 6 is the best possible grade.

